  "contract": "Field bosses (Config.FieldBosses; the King Slime A23-84/85, king_slime_split §3): one of each on the server, first slot FirstDelay s after start, then every Interval s from its last appearance, a due slot waits for a ready hunter in its zone, stays Lifetime s; spot Attr on workspace.Map > (Hill) HillTop + 8 toward HillPathFoot (flat) > Spawn > a zone spawn point, Radius; no ground = retry in RetryDelay s; defeat = Fx KingDefeat { Key, Kind, Pos, Contributors (numbers) } to all + <Key>Defeat + Defeated(key, kind, ids, rec); time up / lost model = RemoveEvent(fade, leaving) + <Key>Leave; GameState <Key>Active / EndsAt / NextAt. King Slime: 180 / 480 / 300 s, KingSpawn, hill. BigSlime = Slime Prince; the card is SlimeKing's.",
